  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I noticed several inconsistencies with API-A Lite responses while working on refactoring item 1814192 (Constants for namespace/schema uris/locs).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "1) Object Profile has a dateTime attribute, but other API-A responses use the attribute \"asOfDateTime\".",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "2) Many responses have a baseURL attribute on the root (I'm not sure of the purpose of this), but Object Profile (for one) doesn't.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
