  "description": "<p>I noticed several inconsistencies with API-A Lite responses while working on refactoring item 1814192 (Constants for namespace/schema uris/locs).</p>\n\n<p>1) Object Profile has a dateTime attribute, but other API-A responses use the attribute \"asOfDateTime\".</p>\n\n<p>2) Many responses have a baseURL attribute on the root (I'm not sure of the purpose of this), but Object Profile (for one) doesn't.</p>",
